# Assets are ignored by default; the files the new design actually ships are
# un-ignored explicitly below so a fresh clone renders the site.
assets/*
assets/legacy/

# Design tool assets are required for the site to render (car photos, masks, logo)
!design-tool/assets/
!design-tool/assets/**

# --- assets shipped by the 2026 design ---
!assets/baanbow-logo.png
!assets/car-grey.jpg
!assets/hero-drone.mp4
!assets/hero-poster.jpg
!assets/bow-1-360.mp4
!assets/bow-2-360.mp4
!assets/bow-3-360.mp4
!assets/bow-4-360.mp4
!assets/bow-1-poster.jpg
!assets/bow-2-poster.jpg
!assets/bow-3-poster.jpg
!assets/bow-4-poster.jpg
!assets/booth-1.jpg
!assets/booth-2.jpg
!assets/booth-3.jpg
!assets/booth-4.jpg
!assets/booth-6.jpg
!assets/booth-7.jpg
!assets/w-*.webp
!assets/story-photo.webp
!assets/bows/
!assets/bows/**

# ต้นฉบับภาพโบว์ที่ย่อแล้วลง assets/bows/ — เก็บไว้บนเครื่อง ไม่เข้า git
โบว์แบบที่1/
โบว์แบบที่2/
โบว์แบบที่3/

# Heavy binary inputs — kept on disk, not in git history (89MB / 40MB)
uploads/
design_handoff_baanbow_site/
design-tool/uploads/

# wrangler local state (worker/ มี .gitignore ของตัวเองอีกชั้น)
.wrangler/
